  "description": "A comprehensive library for managing Busy Tag devices via USB serial and cloud communication on Windows, macOS, and Linux. Supports device discovery, file management, LED control, pattern configuration, cloud connectivity, Wi-Fi scanning, and ESP32-S3 firmware recovery.",
